    "text": "An experiment yields <math> <mn>3</mn> </math> mutually exclusive and exhaustive events <math><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>B</mi></math> and <math><mi>C</mi></math><math> <mo>.</mo> </math> If <math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math> then <math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to"
